Version: 1.0
Type: software
Title: 4DMP-MR-BC - causal and druggable discovery in breast cancer
       from blood DNA methylation
Abstract: >-
  Analysis code for an integrated study combining differential methylation
  analysis, cis-meQTL Mendelian randomisation, colocalisation, a phenome-wide
  screen, plasma-proteomic mediation analysis and single-cell transcriptomic
  contextualisation in breast cancer.
